mod-host-pistomp (0.10.6-6) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Restore aggregated MIDI mode. The 0.10.6-5 build resolved no jack >=
    1.9.0 at compile time, so upstream's Makefile left -DHAVE_JACK2
    undefined and compiled out the body of effects_aggregated_midi_enable.
    mod-host therefore never loaded mod-midi-merger or
    mod-midi-broadcaster as JACK internal clients: MOD-UI drew the
    All MIDI In port, but cables dragged from it connected to a JACK port
    that did not exist, and silently failed. Audio and separated-mode MIDI
    were unaffected, which is why it went unnoticed.
  * Assert HAVE_JACK2 at build time (pkg-config check before the build,
    jack_internal_client_load symbol check after) so a feature-stripped
    binary can never ship again.

 -- Cam Gorrie <sastraxi@gmail.com>  Tue, 18 Aug 2026 02:59:38 +0000

